  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Show version and source ID at the right edge of the toolbar, with UTC build time underneath.\n- Add the full build time and source commit to the copyable Debug info report.\n- Label source archives without Git metadata as `Custom Build`; mark locally modified checkouts.\n- Keep toolbar metadata fixed in UI snapshot tests and update the three affected snapshots.\n\n## Validation\n\n- User visually checked the two-line toolbar layout.\n- `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1 CARGO_HOME=/tmp/camcraft-cargo cargo test --locked -p camcraft-ui --lib snapshot`: 3 passed.\n- `CARGO_HOME=/tmp/camcraft-cargo cargo test --locked -p camcraft-ui --lib`: 289 passed, 2 ignored.\n- `git diff --cached --check`: passed.\n- Not exercised: packaged release builds on other operating systems; the new build metadata is read from the local checkout during compilation.\n\nChangelog: Show the version, UTC build time and source commit in the toolbar and Debug info.\n\nFixes #352\n",
